      {text:'Desk research is usually cheaper and faster, but the data may be outdated or not fit the specific question.', richtig:true},
      {text:'A scenario analysis (scenario funnel) shows a best case, a worst case and a trend scenario for future developments.', richtig:true},
      {text:'A survey of the founders’ friends is representative of all students.', fehler:'Such a sample is biased; a representative sample must reflect the structure of the target group.'}
